{"id":"d58a8fe240a8ca83","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-nrandom-hierarchy.md","title":"n 随机性的严格层级","display":"thm-nrandom-hierarchy — n 随机性的严格层级","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-nrandom-hierarchy","aliases":["43-thm-nrandom-hierarchy"],"display":"thm-nrandom-hierarchy — n 随机性的严格层级","depends_on":["[[43-df-nrandom]]","[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-jump]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.7，印刷189–194，PDF209–214；§11.10 Theorem 11.10.1，印刷270，PDF290","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-nrandom-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-nrandom-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-nrandom-hierarchy — n 随机性的严格层级"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.7，印刷189–194，PDF209–214；§11.10 Theorem 11.10.1，印刷270，PDF290"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>；定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Random}_n\\)</span> 是由正整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 索引的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上布尔谓词族，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Random}_{n+1}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Random}_n(X)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Random}_{n+1}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Random}_n(X)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Random}_n(X)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Random}_{n+1}(X)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Random}_n(X)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Random}_{n+1}(X)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>相对0<sup>(n−1)构造停机概率Ω，或相对低基定理取得可计算于0</sup>n的n随机点；该点不可能相对0^n随机。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.7，印刷189–194，PDF209–214；§11.10 Theorem 11.10.1，印刷270，PDF290。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-nrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rel-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"75e7e3b6eeecc95e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$；定义见 [[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rel-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"75e7e3b6eeecc95e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$；定义见 [[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$；定义见 [[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Random}_n$ 是由正整数 $n$ 索引的 $2^\\omega$ 上布尔谓词族，见 [[43-df-nrandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Random}_n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Random}_{n+1}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Random}_n(X)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Random}_n(X)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Random}_{n+1}(X)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1377,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-226","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-nrandom-hierarchy]] — n 随机性的严格层级"}],"outgoing":["86bdc33f83ee57a9","75e7e3b6eeecc95e","b3936ae4c5d2dc79"]}